mbark on an adventure of a lifetime in hopes of finding true love.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUdp3aWU3Dc4WL767FVKSDtgnW4.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2024-05-30\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Start Of My Love Story\",\"overview\":\"Four new Farmers begin the journey to find love with a series of speed dates and each choose five special singles to return to their farms.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7b3xihgixfm2P5YLRuCthfm9o6d.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-30\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Don't You Like Me Enough Now?\",\"overview\":\"Flexing their country charm, the Farmers each sweep one lucky Dater off their feet for a 24-hour one-on-one date on their farms. As connections bloom, tensions and jealousy rise following the arrival of the remaining singles to the homesteads. Host Sabrina Jalees offers the Farmers an unexpected choice.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o9kDW5QrnKKituGHByD3xdYGGko.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Definitely a Red Flag\",\"overview\":\"Amidst uncertain emotions, the Daters get down and dirty on the farms. As tough decisions lie ahead, the Farmers embark on new romantic one-on-one dates and hearts start to soar. For the first time, the Farmers must make the difficult choice to say goodbye to one person during an emotional farewell dinner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gSuw9g6oNa0b3BBEXgH07chJIrX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Quagmire of Emotions\",\"overview\":\"The Farmers and Daters kick up their heels and let loose at a barn dance. With the air buzzing, special surprise visitors offer up important advice on and off the dance floor. While some Daters two-step, others side-step the truth, connections deepen, and unexpected turns add to the emotional night.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uCc3PcKlO9P2h7v80dla4jSyulx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"This Is Trouble\",\"overview\":\"The Farmers open their hearts during new one-on-one dates, but an unexpected choice could close the door on some relationships forever.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qxEzIH8yyY4ArE33AomAkHBjSQ9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-06-26\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Dagger to the Heart\",\"overview\":\"With the experience halfway through, one Farmer takes a leap of faith while the others navigate a herd of unsettled emotions with their remaining Daters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hY5TBd2LX64pqagEbGCigApWJu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Thirsty for Some Answers\",\"overview\":\"Pent-up feelings are uncorked on a trip to wine country. After a proposal backfires, one Farmer faces a difficult decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2FG1l03yGYxUkRT6oCDmYTkdj58.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Souls Are Going to Be Crushed\",\"overview\":\"Following the journey to wine country, the Daters must make the most of their remaining one-on-one dates with their Farmers, knowing that a farewell supper is on the horizon. Between emotional disconnects, an unexpected farewell, and a post-date confrontation, Farmers are more torn than ever as they prepare for their ultimate decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gQkkdPE0bnvrsslPjl6pAoTuVg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"I Think This Is Farewell\",\"overview\":\"Ahead of a meet and greet with the final Daters' loved ones, the Farmers enjoy farewell dinners on the farm and deliver surprising and devastating goodbyes.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1sUsjRTOQnkw0EpiVVv8pOVU6vG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-24\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"I Want Us to Be Together\",\"overview\":\"Everything comes down to this moment. With their hearts on the line, the Farmers are preparing for a life-changing decision. In the spectacular season finale, emotions run high as the Farmers lay out their hearts in the hopes of finding their true love.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7PATsJKJlNyec1Ew7xBczGJAAWL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-07-31\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-05-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}